====Aftermath====
Scott Lee Cohen was replaced as the Democratic lieutenant gubernatorial nominee by former Carbondale City Councilwoman [[Sheila Simon]] after he withdrew due to allegations of abuse toward his wife and other charges.<ref name="suntimes1"/>

